  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## New Version\n* Bump `application_builder_helpers` from `4.1.143` to `4.1.145`. See [changelog](https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/application_builder_helpers/4.1.143...application_builder_helpers/4.1.145)\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(cli): group-path unknown/invalid beats version (Fixes #586) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/587\n* fix(cli): uniform version-wins for InvalidValue (Fixes #585) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/588\n* fix(cli): single-dash-long full-token error and valued-last cluster rule (Fixes #592) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/609\n* fix(cli): help-first routes valid trailing subcommand to target help by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/612\n* fix(cli): symmetric --help/--version reserved-value rejection (Fixes #594) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/611\n* fix(cli): strict duplicate/missing-value for repeated valued options (Fixes #593) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/613\n* docs: slim comments, rewrite guides, split ADR collisions by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/616\n* chore(deps): rebase-only dependabot auto-merge by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/617\n* feat(cli): add -? and /? help aliases (all OS) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/619\n* cli: expose bool --no-* negation in help + reject bare --no-valued (Fixes #597) by @Kiryuumaru in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/621\n* Bump AbsolutePathHelpers from 0.3.146 to 0.3.148 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/622\n* Bump NukeBuildHelpers from 9.0.41 to 9.0.47 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/pull/623\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Kiryuumaru/ApplicationBuilderHelpers/compare/build.20260927052237.9a33c35...build.20261001103733.6353458",
